---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Skill Foundry"
  description="Read the terms for using Skill Foundry, its educational resources, and original materials."
  canonical="https://hub.skillfoundry-web.workers.dev/terms/"
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="legal-container">
        <p class="legal-eyebrow">TERMS</p>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="legal-lead">These terms explain how you may access and use Skill Foundry and its original educational resources.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-body">
      <div class="legal-container">
        <div class="legal-content">
          <section class="legal-section-block">
            <h2>1. Using Skill Foundry</h2>
            <p>By accessing or using this website, you agree to follow these terms. Skill Foundry provides tutorials, prompts, workflows and related material to support practical learning, experimentation and personal projects.</p>
            <p>You may use the instructions and adapt them for your own personal and educational projects, subject to these terms and the rules of any third-party tools involved.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section-block">
            <h2>2. Ownership and permitted use</h2>
            <p>Unless a page states otherwise, the original written content, guides, prompts, designs and other materials published by Skill Foundry belong to Skill Foundry or are used with permission. They are provided for personal and educational use.</p>
            <p>You may not sell, commercially exploit, republish, redistribute or present Skill Foundry's original materials as your own without prior permission. This restriction does not claim ownership of independent work you create yourself or of third-party materials, which remain subject to their respective owners' terms.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section-block">
            <h2>3. Responsible use</h2>
            <p>You are responsible for how you use the resources, prompts and workflows provided on this website. Do not use them to violate applicable laws, infringe another person's rights, or breach the terms or policies of a service you use.</p>
            <p>Before using an external tool, check its current rules, permissions and usage limits. You are responsible for reviewing the material you submit to third-party services.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section-block">
            <h2>4. Results and limitations</h2>
            <p>Skill Foundry aims to make its published resources useful, understandable and actionable, and resources are personally tested through actual execution before publication. However, tools, models, features and interfaces can change after a resource is published.</p>
            <p>AI-generated results may vary between attempts, even when the same instructions are followed. Examples and tutorials are educational guidance; they do not guarantee identical outputs, specific outcomes, accuracy or suitability for every project.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section-block">
            <h2>5. Third-party services</h2>
            <p>Some resources may refer to or link to external websites, software, AI tools or other services. These services are operated independently and have their own terms, privacy policies, availability and practices.</p>
            <p>Skill Foundry does not control third-party services. You should review their terms before using them. Any interaction you have with those services is between you and the relevant provider.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section-block">
            <h2>6. Website content and availability</h2>
            <p>Skill Foundry may update, revise, replace or remove website content and features as the resource library develops. We may also correct errors or change how parts of the website work.</p>
            <p>We aim to keep the website accessible, but do not guarantee uninterrupted availability or that every resource or feature will remain available at all times.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section-block legal-section-last">
            <h2>7. Questions and contact</h2>
            <p>If you have a question about these terms, want to request permission to use original Skill Foundry material, or need to report an issue, contact us using the Contact us button below.</p>
            <a class="legal-contact-button" href="/contact/?subject=Question%20about%20these%20terms">Contact us</a>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    min-height: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-container {
    width: min(780px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .legal-hero {
    padding: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 40px) 0 22px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #1E293B);
    background: transparent;
  }

  .legal-title {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: #F8FAFC;
    font-size: clamp(27px, 4vw, 34px);
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .legal-lead {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 680px;
    color: #94A3B8;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .legal-body {
    padding: 24px 0 0;
  }

  .legal-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  :global(main .legal-page .legal-content) { gap: 0 !important; }

  .legal-contact-button { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; width:fit-content; margin-top:18px; min-height:40px; padding:0 16px; border:1px solid #A8C8DF; border-radius:9px; background:#C5DDED; color:#183247; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:750; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; cursor:pointer; }

  :global(.legal-page .legal-section-block) {
    padding: 0 0 22px;
  }

  :global(.legal-page .legal-section-block + .legal-section-block) {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sf-page-divider);
    padding-top: 22px;
  }

  :global(.legal-page .legal-section-block h2) {
    margin: 0 0 18px !important;
    color: var(--sf-page-heading);
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2.4vw, 20px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  :global(.legal-page .legal-section-block p) {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 0 14px !important;
    color: var(--sf-page-copy);
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  :global(.legal-page .legal-section-block p:last-of-type) {
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  :global(.legal-page .legal-section-last) {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  :global(.legal-page .legal-section-block a) {
    color: var(--sf-page-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  :global(main:has(.legal-page) > .sf-global-cta) {
    padding-top: 36px !important;
  }

  :global([data-theme="light"]) .legal-title,
  :global(html.light-theme) .legal-title {
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  :global([data-theme="light"]) .legal-lead,
  :global(html.light-theme) .legal-lead {
    color: #475569;
  }

  :global([data-theme="light"]) .legal-section-block h2,
  :global(html.light-theme) .legal-section-block h2 {
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  :global([data-theme="light"]) .legal-section-block p,
  :global(html.light-theme) .legal-section-block p {
    color: #334155;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-container {
      width: calc(100% - 32px);
    }

    .legal-hero {
      padding: 26px 0 20px;
    }

    .legal-title {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .legal-body {
      padding-top: 20px;
    }

    :global(.legal-page .legal-section-block) {
      padding-bottom: 20px;
    }

    :global(.legal-page .legal-section-block + .legal-section-block) {
      padding-top: 20px;
    }

    :global(.legal-page .legal-section-block h2) {
      margin-bottom: 16px !important;
    }

    :global(.legal-page .legal-section-block p) {
      margin-bottom: 12px !important;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    :global(.legal-page .legal-section-block p:last-of-type) {
      margin-bottom: 0 !important;
    }

    :global(.legal-page .legal-section-last) {
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    :global(main:has(.legal-page) > .sf-global-cta) {
      padding-top: 24px !important;
    }
  }
</style>
